OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells 
OL,6,Fleading to another frost in east. Rain 
OL,7,Freaching the Isles and west coast by   
OL,8,Fmidnight edging into West Highland     
OL,9,Fovernight. Strengthening southeasterly 
OL,10,Fwinds.                                 
OL,12,CTuesday:FBright start for Northeast    
OL,13,FHighland otherwise cloudy with         
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain turning heavier with 
OL,15,Fsome snow on hills especially around   
OL,16,FDrumochter. Rather cold and windy.     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
